    {"id": "importSuggestions", "note": "What this Mac has that cmux can bring over (CmuxNextImportCards), every card found."},
    {"id": "channels", "note": "Every release channel's recent builds, with the one this Mac runs (Settings > Updates)."},
    {"id": "appUpdate", "note": "The app update's status: a check, a download's progress and Cancel, Restart to Update, a failure's Try Again (Settings > Updates; the sidebar shows only the staged update)."},
    {"id": "webUpdates", "note": "The web UI served now, its last check and Roll Back (plans/cmux-next/web-ota.md); NIGHTLY only."},
    {"id": "voiceInput", "note": "Settings > Chief's Voice input row: the Debug toggle home.voiceInput, only where it exists."},
    {"id": "notices", "note": "Settings > Chief's Notices row: it opens Notifications, which holds the Chief's notices."},
    {"id": "contextMenus", "note": "Settings > Menus: every right-click menu's rows, arranged by the person (ContextMenuLayout)."},
    {"id": "server", "note": "Settings > Server: each server's status, version line, Restart Recommended, socket and tailnet address (plans/cmux-next/server-updates-DESIGN.md section 10)."},
    {"id": "cloudEnvironments", "note": "Settings > Accounts > Cloud Environments: the team's environments, Build, Delete and Add (plans/cmux-next/cloud-environments-DESIGN.md); `cmux.settings.environments.*`."},
    {"id": "tailnet", "note": "Settings > Server > This Mac on Your Tailnet: sign this Mac's own tailnet node in or out (acpmux's embedded node, `_acpmux/tailnet/*`, relayed by the app on its person connection); `cmux.settings.tailnet.*`. Shown only where acpmux answers."},
    {"id": "sharedLinks", "note": "Settings > Privacy and Security > Shared Links: every chat this Mac shared by link or invite, with Revoke and Revoke All (design chat-multiplayer.md 2); `cmux.settings.shares.*`. Deep link: #/settings/privacy?focus=card.sharedLinks."},
    {"id": "worktreeSetup", "note": "Settings > Agents > Worktree Setup: a project's worktree recipe (setup, run and teardown scripts, files to copy) over the repository's .worktreeinclude and .cmux/worktree.toml (design/worktree-setup.md); `cmux.project.list`, `cmux.project.update` and `cmux.git.worktree.setup` through the page relay."}
  ],
